cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "ale-cooccurrence-nf: ALEdb mutation QC and gene co-occurrence analysis"
authors:
  - given-names: Binhuan
    family-names: Sun
  - given-names: Adam M.
    family-names: Feist
  - given-names: Patrick V.
    family-names: Phaneuf
  - given-names: Alberto
    family-names: Santos
repository-code: "https://github.com/Multiomics-Analytics-Group/ale-cooccurrence-nf"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow pipeline, run in one Docker image, for the mutation calls of
  adaptive laboratory evolution (ALE) experiments exported from ALEdb. It cleans
  the calls into one table of endpoint mutations. It then tests, within each
  experiment, pairs of mutated genes for co-occurrence and mutual exclusivity
  with DISCOVER and with Fisher's exact test.
keywords:
  - adaptive laboratory evolution
  - ALEdb
  - co-occurrence
  - mutual exclusivity
  - Nextflow
